# Ultima Weapon ({7}, equip {7}): Black Lotus, Sol Ring (paid with Mox Pearl), Mox Ruby and Mox Jet pay for it on turn 1 and a free
# Ornithopter comes down. Turn 3 has only six mana, one short of Equip {7}, so it is refused (CR 702.6a). Turn 5 has seven: the
# Ornithopter becomes 7/7 and, attacking, triggers "destroy target creature an opponent controls": Bot1's own Ornithopter is no
# legal target (CR 115.1), so Bot2's Ornithopter is chosen and Bot2's Memnite stays. Bot2 takes 7.

